  "purpose": "Single deterministic authority for Havenwild macro geography, normalized structural elevation, hydrology, terrain topology, caves, ecology, detail decoration, settlements, runtime recipes, maps, persistence and seasonal visual providers.",
  "invariants": [
    "world seed is the root of all generated content but each domain receives an independently derived deterministic seed",
    "ordinary structural authoring is discrete Level 0/2/3/4; Level 1 is reserved for certified 2\u21921\u21920 ramp transition cells; no freeform numeric elevation painting",
    "generated freshwater has a complete downhill drainage path and cannot terminate arbitrarily on land",
    "flowing water crossing a certified structural drop creates a waterfall connector; Level 1 may only occur inside a certified ramp transition and is not generic cliff terrain",
    "canonical semantics and topology are resolved before visual providers",
    "season/provider changes cannot change topology, collision, cave identity, roads, hydrology or world seed",
    "raw source pixels never define collision, navigation, gameplay values or PCG ownership",
    "details may decorate a host recipe but may not silently alter host topology",
    "all infinite-world cross-chunk features are coordinate/feature-seed deterministic",
    "authored, generated and player-modified layers remain separately owned"
  ],
